bl" data-selectable-paragraph=3D"">Lets start with the name itself: <strong=
 class=3D"no hm">GPT</strong> stands for <strong class=3D"no hm"><em class=
=3D"ol">Generative Pre-trained Transformer</em></strong>.</p><p id=3D"742f"=
