y nz oa ob oc od oe of og oh oi oj he bl" data-selectable-paragraph=3D""><s=
trong class=3D"no hm"><em class=3D"ol">=E2=80=9CGenerative=E2=80=9D</em></s=
trong> here tells us that we are dealing with sequences. In the case of the=
 GPT models, these sequences are usually in the domain of natural language.=
 However, this approach can be applied to any type of sequential data.</p><=
