ning each word a unique integer value</li><li id=3D"08bf" class=3D"nm nn hl=
 no b np op nr ns nt oq nv nw nx or nz oa ob os od oe of ot oh oi oj om on =
oo bl" data-selectable-paragraph=3D"">mapping that integer value to a fixed=
