-paragraph nm nn hl no b np nq nr ns nt nu nv nw nx ny nz oa ob oc od oe of=
 og oh oi oj he bl" data-selectable-paragraph=3D"">At the time of writing, =
we don=E2=80=99t know how many parameters are used in GPT-4, nor do we know=
 the size of the dataset involved. However, it is safe to say that it will =
be larger than GPT-3 (most likely <strong class=3D"no hm">a lot</strong> la=
rger). There are many reports from =E2=80=9Canonymous sources=E2=80=9D plac=
ing it at over 1 trillion parameters, but this has yet to be confirmed. Tha=
t being said, given the exponential increase in parameters between GPT mode=
ls thus far, this is indeed the probable case.</p><h2 id=3D"55ff" class=3D"=
